OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrests after 'unexplained
OL,4,Adeath'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been arrested on suspicion
OL,7,Fof murder after a man died at a
OL,8,Fproperty in Lincolnshire.
OL,10,FPolice received a call that a man in
OL,11,Fhis 50s had been found with serious
OL,12,Finjuries at an address on John King
OL,13,FStreet in Holbeach at about 10:00 GMT
OL,14,Fon Monday.
OL,16,FThe man died at the scene and two men
OL,17,Faged 27 and 60 were arrested on
OL,18,Fsuspicion of murder, Lincolnshire
OL,19,FPolice said.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
